    "detailed_description": "You stand amidst the ruins of war. The world is running out of nutrients and it's your job to make them. Design. Build. Execute. Restore the world to what it once was. Uncover the truths of your own past. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/5a59b09444a01f6f5a4050764666e830.poster.avif?t=1731254008\" width=648 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/5a59b09444a01f6f5a4050764666e830.webm?t=1731254008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/5a59b09444a01f6f5a4050764666e830.mp4?t=1731254008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0 INVENT YOUR OWN SOLUTIONS </h2><br>No solution is predetermined. Utilize your own creativity and critical thinking to invent a mechanism that has never been made before.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0 UNCOVER YOUR PAST </h2><br>Every robot has a creator. What were you really designed for? What comes next?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0 EXPAND YOUR TOOLKIT </h2><br>Unlock new parts which increase the number of ways you can express your creativity and make the most challenging levels manageable. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/de6b4862d8505185ebeedc66c51245b4.poster.avif?t=1731254008\" width=648 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/de6b4862d8505185ebeedc66c51245b4.webm?t=1731254008\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2917850/extras/de6b4862d8505185ebeedc66c51245b4.mp4?t=1731254008\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u25a0 FEATURES </h2><br>\u2014 20+ levels to test your problem solving skills<br>\u2014 Optional levels to test your limits<br>\u2014 3 different acts each with their own unique environment and puzzle elements<br>\u2014 A built in recorder to share your solutions as a .gif<br>\u2014 Create your own stages with a built in level editor",
